       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. COMPOUND-INTEREST.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 PRINCIPAL PIC 9(7)V99.
       01 RATE PIC 9(3)V99.
       01 TIME-PERIOD PIC 9(3).
       01 AMOUNT-VALUE PIC 9(10)V99.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           DISPLAY "Enter principal: " WITH NO ADVANCING. ACCEPT PRINCIPAL.
           DISPLAY "Enter annual rate: " WITH NO ADVANCING. ACCEPT RATE.
           DISPLAY "Enter years: " WITH NO ADVANCING. ACCEPT TIME-PERIOD.
           COMPUTE AMOUNT-VALUE = PRINCIPAL * (1 + RATE / 100) ** TIME-PERIOD.
           DISPLAY "Compound amount: " AMOUNT-VALUE.
           STOP RUN.
